==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.53~1.13 seconds<sup>16f~34f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**1 [[Snowball]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Snowball]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Ice Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**1 [[Chocolate Doge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 85% HP:
**1 [[Snowball]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Chocolate Doge]] spawns.
**3 [[Ice Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**5 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
None of the enemies here are pushers except for the Chocolate Doge. Still, a general tanker such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] can perma stall the Chocolate Doge, and the other two doges involved, trivializing the stage. To beat the Pigeon de Sables that spawn at the beginning, [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is your best bet, as they will stack up and surge spam any meatshields, making them glass cannons. Even if you lack Paris Cat, any decent midranger can beat them.

